# Data that must never reach a repository. Silueta exists to keep people out of corpora; the corpora
# themselves, the rosters they were checked against and the vaults that can undo the work stay local.
*.vault.json
vault.json
roster*.json
*.deid.txt
/data/
/corpus/
/samples/private/

# …except the made-up ones that document the format.
!**/*.example.json

# The working desk: state, pending work, committee briefs and the audits they produce. Working notes
# name unfinished work and unfixed defects, and none of that is ready for a stranger to read as if it
# were documentation. Public defects become GitHub issues instead — see AI_Tasks/README.md.
AI_Tasks/
.audits/

# Local pack output
out/
